title: EDR Minifilter Driver Unloaded
id: a71ed5f2-3b98-472d-8e55-3a96a43b5a67
status: experimental
description: Detects fltmc unload targeting an EDR or AV minifilter driver altitude, a defense-evasion technique to detach the security product from filesystem and process telemetry without stopping its service.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\fltmc.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: 'unload'
  selection_drv:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'CSAgent'
      - 'SentinelMonitor'
      - 'CarbonBlack'
      - 'edrsensor'
      - 'WdFilter'
  condition: selection and selection_drv
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Authorized troubleshooting of security drivers
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1562.001
